{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "审计过也被打穿",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 56.26,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2021 年 5 月，PancakeBunny 被攻击，损失约 4500 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 5 月，PancakeBunny 被攻击，损失约 4500 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 7.096
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "这个项目，做过审计。",
   "spoken": "这个项目，做过审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.5,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 7.5,
   "speechEnd": 9.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "可审计方事后说明，被利用的那份代码，是审计之后才上线的版本。",
   "spoken": "可审计方事后说明，被利用的那份代码，是审计之后才上线的版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 9.56,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 9.56,
   "speechEnd": 15.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "审计看的是一份代码，链上跑的是另一份。",
   "spoken": "审计看的是一份代码，链上跑的是另一份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 15.7,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 15.7,
   "speechEnd": 19.509
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "攻击，就发生在那个没被审过的版本上。",
   "spoken": "攻击，就发生在那个没被审过的版本上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 19.92,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 20.015,
   "speechEnd": 23.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "审计本身没有失败，出问题的，是审计和上线之间的那一段。",
   "spoken": "审计本身没有失败，出问题的，是审计和上线之间的那一段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 23.9,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 23.9,
   "speechEnd": 29.144
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "项目上线时，常常会说一句，我们通过了审计。",
   "spoken": "项目上线时，常常会说一句，我们通过了审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 29.56,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 29.56,
   "speechEnd": 33.634
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 34.1,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 34.1,
   "speechEnd": 34.901
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "项目方能不能用，我们通过了审计，来证明线上的代码是安全的？",
   "spoken": "项目方能不能用，我们通过了审计，来证明线上的代码是安全的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 35.36,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 35.451,
   "speechEnd": 40.115
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "想一想，审计报告证明的，到底是哪一份代码。",
   "spoken": "想一想，审计报告证明的，到底是哪一份代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 40.82,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 40.82,
   "speechEnd": 45.239
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "还有，审计之后改过的代码，谁来看？",
   "spoken": "还有，审计之后改过的代码，谁来看？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 45.68,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 45.68,
   "speechEnd": 48.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "带着这两个问题，我们看看，安全怎样写进开发的每一步。",
   "spoken": "带着这两个问题，我们看看，安全怎样写进开发的每一步。",
